sequenceDiagram
    %% Comments flow 4 of 4 — Retry and like
    %% Both are optimistic-first. Retry is idempotent on clientId;
    %% like rolls back if the write is refused.
    %% Participants map to:
    %%   SH  ios/CommentSheetView.swift
    %%   NV  ios/RNPdfViewer.swift (RNPdfView)
    %%   JS  src/components/PdfViewer.js
    %%   MS  src/screens/ManuscriptScreen.js
    %%   ST  src/stores/commentsStore.js
    %%   API src/services/commentsService.js
    autonumber
    actor R as Reader
    participant SH as CommentSheetView
    participant NV as RNPdfView
    participant JS as PdfViewer.js
    participant MS as ManuscriptScreen.js
    participant ST as commentsStore
    participant API as commentsService
    participant SRV as Server

    rect rgb(245, 242, 236)
    Note over R,SRV: Retry a failed comment
    R->>SH: tap "Couldn't send, Retry"
    SH->>NV: commentSheet(didRetry: comment)
    NV->>JS: onRetryComment(clientId)
    JS->>MS: onRetryComment(clientId)
    MS->>ST: retryComment(bookId, clientId)
    ST->>ST: locate the comment and its thread, mark pending=true failed=false
    ST-->>MS: byBook updated, sheet re-renders with a spinner
    ST->>API: createComment with the SAME clientId
    API->>SRV: POST /room/{roomId}/book/{bookId}/comments
    Note over SRV: Idempotent on clientId. If an earlier attempt<br/>landed, the original row comes back<br/>instead of a duplicate
    SRV-->>ST: 201 saved row
    ST->>ST: swap by clientId
    ST-->>MS: byBook updated, sheet re-renders clean
    end

    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)
    Note over R,SRV: Like a comment
    R->>SH: tap heart
    SH->>NV: commentSheet(didLike: comment)
    NV->>JS: onLikeComment(commentId)
    JS->>MS: onLikeComment(commentId)
    MS->>ST: toggleLike(bookId, commentId)
    ST->>ST: write(!wasLiked) locally, adjust likes count
    ST-->>MS: byBook updated, heart fills instantly
    ST->>API: likeComment or unlikeComment
    API->>SRV: POST or DELETE /comments/{id}/like
    alt 200 or 204
        SRV-->>ST: ok
    else refused
        SRV-->>ST: error
        ST->>ST: write(wasLiked), roll back
        ST-->>MS: byBook updated, heart reverts
    end
    end
